  "end": 4264,
  "block": 12,
  "bank": "scene",
  "spk": "8061:2d,0,0",
  "kind": "dlg",
  "en": "\"I wondered which would truly be more{n} useful: you humans, who are defective,{n} or the prototype Machine Men.\"",
